attempts.raw:
@start **The window opens on a single spine column.** Column 0, `yegH`, is carried by 100% of chromosomes, persistent, in a region of plasticity in 13% of calls, and the model names 99% of them {S1, W}. It is the only spine column before the long variable stretch {S1}.

@variable **Columns 1 to 21 are variable, all shell, carried by 54 to 83%**, the `wca` genes, [[colanic acid biosynthesis]] {S2.c1-21, Q}. Then columns 23 to 33, variable, carried by 7 to 39%, [[dTDP-rhamnose synthesis]] {S2.c23-33, Q}. Through columns 60 to 62 a branch of 3 shell families runs in 15%, and through columns 72 to 76 a branch of 5 shell families runs in 14 to 15%, [[propanediol dehydratase]] {S10.b60, S10.b72, Q}.

@model **The model names more genes on the spine columns than on the fork and variable ones**, 88% against 75%, and hesitates less there, 0.44 against 0.90 bits {M}. Its most hesitant column, 23, `rfbB`, is a variable column, at 2.13 bits {H}.

@end **The window ends in fork columns.** Columns 52 to 79 are carried by 7 to 84% of chromosomes, and the model names 73 to 88% of them {S10}. The last column is `yeeN`, in 34% of chromosomes {E}.

@whole **Across the window it names 78% of genes**, 0.81 bits on average, perplexity 2.9 families {G}. Inside a region of plasticity it hesitates more than outside, 1.09 against 0.40 bits, and names fewer genes, 68% against 91% {C}.

